<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuelan forces bombed an ELN guerrilla camp in Apure, killing at least 19 rebels, while a U.S. drone strike hit an ELN drug depot nearby, killing at least 20. The United States is negotiating a legal framework for troops in Caracas, coordinating drone strikes with Venezuelan authorities, and discussing a one-day operation to capture Maduro, as Rubio said U.S. talks aim to establish a military presence in Venezuela and elections would ideally be held next year. Colombia expelled 80 allegedly criminal Venezuelans, arresting ten on arrival, and a special-forces soldier who bet $400,000 on Maduro’s capture pleaded not guilty. 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQOWNEdXlRQ2U1M3Z2aVgzLXk0S1ZPLWRrUi1qVkVEdUhZel9XamI2ZEg1X2VOZ3ZOMTRQYkw3ZW9nWGYzd3IzVlg2U01vblFSVTFOMnpCRk9UN2FfUGgwRjlaam95YWNIeWtsNTk0cVBfLWxtTmFXUlMwUHc5aVpYcTBaemZmaG8?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPRkdYaklER2lEbFRnMVdoTmllTERsU3JhN1ZuUkE4ZWZISEdIa0s1YVNuUmVXWTJTcThLM01leVdBWTZSdVFZdVNsOXQ5TU5TV0ZJMllNT3ZPUWxQU256MDRVVEdrX1BTdzhPSnNfQzc0VWhKb2ttMWxDYVA1R3I3d1hFM1o4a0dqNzdwcUtQSm13dldxOWxndHZzaFQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOb19kbjZoNTBPaGNqNUFKeFZYR2dzOWlNN0ZfS0hRUC1zWUR5TWgwM3pnWmtTSGNDcEsybFVwUktHY1BSQ0pxOTdvLVZFbC1Gc25KVjBLbWNUZTVOejhpZjhUajU2emRCSU1CZHVkdU44Znh2b21WQnhPTWM5YllzM2kwSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE9PbkxXMDRiOFU5dnhmSVhlQUI3Ymhvcm92RGhXbktLazEtYTh2S1hfMzdaRHN0TElhZmFuMk9PVVFaYl9HWDZuRERZeVVFQ21zOWpmb2V4TTlhb05YYzZPNF9YT2FZQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Unisba Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/